★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────
Spring Boot 4 restructured its once-monolithic `spring-boot-project` into dozens of single-purpose Gradle modules under `spring-boot/module/<name>/`, each publishing its own jar, sources jar, and javadoc jar to Maven Central under matching coordinates. That's why every sibling entry in this repo follows the exact same three-URL shape — it's not a per-library guess, it's a structural property of how the whole project is built and released.
